sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Player
    participant UI as Website or Discord bot
    participant API as Signup workflow
    participant R as Readiness policy
    P->>UI: Choose raid, availability and character options
    UI->>API: Submit shared signup for authenticated user
    API->>API: Check community access, deadline and character ownership
    API->>R: Evaluate every offered option against every raid target
    alt Any offered character remains locked
        R-->>API: Locked with target and reset evidence
        API-->>UI: Explain conflict so player can change the option
    else Some observations are unknown or stale
        R-->>API: Needs fresh sync
        API->>API: Save response with unresolved readiness
        API-->>UI: Request sync or an explicit officer exception before rostering
    else All offered characters are eligible at raid start
        R-->>API: Available or resets before raid
        API->>API: Create or update one signup for user and raid
        API-->>UI: Confirm saved response and verdicts
    end
    UI-->>P: Show current response on either channel
